 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one lender that’s best for every buyer, but **First State Bank Mortgage** looks like a strong local starting point in St. Charles. It has a mortgage team and office in town, offers purchase loans, and has positive borrower feedback. You can reach its West Clay Street mortgage center at **(636) 940-5626**.\n\nI’d also get a quote from **Integrity Mortgage** in nearby Cottleville, which reports a 4.8/5 Google rating based on 37 reviews, and from one other lender—such as Guild Mortgage—to compare.\n\nBefore choosing, ask each for a **Loan Estimate for the same loan scenario** and compare the APR, lender fees, points, rate-lock terms, and closing timeline. Rates and costs depend on your credit, down payment, loan type, and timing, so reviews alone can’t identify the cheapest or best fit.",
